<h2 class="doc-h2">Custom Close Button</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>&lt;DialogClose&gt;</code> closes the dialog it is inside — no id to point at
    and no handler to write. It used to say <code>formmethod="dialog"</code> here, which the
    platform honours only on a submit button that <em>has a form owner</em>: outside a form
    that button is inert, so the advice produced a Close button that did nothing.
</p>
<Example Source="DialogCustomClose.razor"><DialogCustomClose /></Example>

